Z||000021||grgoyl86||06-12-2001||09:07 PM||||I put the black carpet from an 84 into my 86 GT, and I have some observations for y'all.<P>First, the black carpet is a little harder to keep clean, It attracts dust!<P>Second, I think it would fit right into any Fiero that does not have the coolong fan in the trunk. Between the fan and the duct, it was a tough fit. I got mine looking pretty decent, thanks to help from my buddy Denny!<P>Since I have black carpet in the interior and the front trunk is done in black carpet, I almost HAD to make the rear trunk black.<P>Bob||||reg||1
